note for AssetTopology "Core business authority: Asset and Node lifecycle, active placement, and enrollment eligibility."
note for BindingProjectionPort "Core stores a minimal business association projection and history. It does not own technical identity or credentials."
note for EnrollmentOperationPort "Core stores business orchestration and recovery status; Fleet executes technical operations."
note for FleetManager "Fleet technical authority: installation identity, enrollment, credentials, authentication, binding enforcement, and runtime lifecycle."
note for FleetExternalContracts "Fleet-specific external contracts and DTOs are application ports, not a Core Fleet business domain."
